1072
01:05:52.680 --> 01:05:54.013
Let's do one thing.

1073
01:05:54.805 --> 01:05:56.055
Let's call your dad.

1074
01:05:56.138 --> 01:05:57.388
- Shall I?
- No, sir.

1075
01:05:57.472 --> 01:05:58.555
No?

1076
01:05:58.847 --> 01:06:00.597
Will you work hard?

1077
01:06:00.680 --> 01:06:01.680
Yes, sir.

1078
01:06:01.722 --> 01:06:02.847
