1106
01:08:28.180 --> 01:08:29.656
Will you speak up
or do I've to give a nudge here?

1107
01:08:29.680 --> 01:08:30.680
No, sir,

1108
01:08:30.763 --> 01:08:32.263
I'll speak up. Not there, sir.

1109
