1110
01:08:35.472 --> 01:08:39.097
Komal knew me
because I tutored her in maths.

1111
01:08:40.222 --> 01:08:41.305
That day...

1112
01:08:47.530 --> 01:08:49.513
Komal, I was in a hurry, and...

1113
