1129
01:10:22.638 --> 01:10:23.722
I didn't kill anyone.

1130
01:10:23.805 --> 01:10:25.180
- You are lying!
- Listen.

1131
01:10:25.722 --> 01:10:27.138
Please go outside.

1132
01:10:27.972 --> 01:10:29.097
Go outside.

1133
01:10:30.638 --> 01:10:31.972
