- I am not that slim.

1181
01:12:45.555 --> 01:12:46.847
Sorry. Please.

1182
01:12:56.555 --> 01:12:57.847
Come on. Come on.

1183
01:12:58.305 --> 01:12:59.138
Come on.

1184
01:12:59.222 --> 01:13:02.763
