Thank you.

1815
02:05:04.833 --> 02:05:06.625
<i>Sofia came home to say sorry.</i>

1816
02:05:06.810 --> 02:05:09.083
<i>But I got satisfaction
by killing her,</i>

1817
02:05:10.750 --> 02:05:12.208
<i>not from her apology.</i>

1818
02:05:17.458 --> 02:05:20.083
<i>Mom took blame for my crime
and went to jail.</i>

1819
02:05:20.708 --> 02:05:21.583
<i>Twelve years later,</i>

1820
02:05:21.667 --> 02:05:23.976
